<title>USA: Pa. $556 mln GOs won by Merrill at 5.21 pct TIC.</title>
<headline>Pa. $556 mln GOs won by Merrill at 5.21 pct TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said Tuesday it won $556 million Pennsylvania general obligation bonds at a true interest cost of 5.21 percent.</p>
